syntax:
for(initialization; condition; update)
{
    // statements
}

examples:
Count from 1 to 10:

for(int count = 1; count <= 10; count++)
{
    cout << count << endl;
}

Count backward from 10 to 1:

for(int count = 10; count >= 1; count--)
{
